5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin. I am interested in the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I'll take the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
